From eb733a57533d14eabf62a8f3754681f3f59f576d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:14:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] Fix: injury history: whole-body moves listed by where
 they hit hardest; causes kept by damage done (not just the last two) and told
 the same in CURRENT CONDITION, WHAT HURT WHERE and the memory line; a rake
 back counts as the last attack that landed; callbacks no longer one beat off

---
 engine.py   | 34 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 narrator.py | 15 ++++++++++++---
 play.py     | 17 ++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

